-- brain-machine-interfaces (2026-11-17 23:12 UTC, Avik): "brain machine interfaces should be a whole node,
-- Facebook has brain research on which video frames produce max neural activity for engagement-maxxing,
-- this connects to everything, from evil tech information warfare and neuralink elon neuroscience".
-- The record it rests on: Meta FAIR's TRIBE (TRImodal Brain Encoder; d'Ascoli, Rapin, Benchetrit et al.,
-- arXiv 2507.22229, 2025), first place in Algonauts 2025, predicts whole-brain fMRI responses to video,
-- audio and text from Llama 3.2, Wav2Vec2-BERT and V-JEPA 2 embeddings; TRIBE v2 (arXiv 2605.04326, 2026),
-- over 1,000 hours of fMRI across 720 subjects, which Meta calls a "digital twin of human neural
-- activity", predicts responses of unseen subjects to novel stimuli. An encoding model with that reach
-- lets stimuli be searched in silico for the response they drive, the method neuroscience already
-- published on animals: images synthesized to drive chosen neurons to their maximum (Bashivan, Kar and
-- DiCarlo, Science 2019; Ponce, Xiao, Schade et al., XDream, Cell 2019). Its readers: Avik's indictment of
-- engagement maximization and information warfare, Neuralink and implanted interfaces (Musk is among the
-- individuals to onboard), the neuroscience the dispel-ignorance work answers, and hyperactivity's own
-- interface, eye contact co-processing at the speed of light (docs/eye-contact-co-processing-at-the-
-- speed-of-light.cub), the receptive interface the engagement interface inverts.
brain-machine-interfaces : Node
brain-machine-interfaces = node "Brain-machine interfaces, from encoding models that predict the brain's response to a stimulus to implanted devices, are known whole: what each can read and drive, who holds it, and to what end." (cons dispel-ignorance-in-neuroscience (cons healing-societies nil))
